License:
This software is licensed, not sold. It is provided free of charge for academic and research use within the EUCAIM project context, exclusively for automated detection and segmentation of neuroblastic tumours in T2-weighted MR images before their federation or upload to the EUCAIM imaging data atlas (reference nodes).

